{"id":"wikibooks:tandoori-tofu","verdict":"keep","recipes":[{"source":"https://en.wikibooks.org/wiki/Cookbook%3ATandoori_Tofu","status":"fixed","reason":"Restored tomato quantity and oven temperature lost from convert templates","ingredients":["1 block firm or extra-firm tofu","2–3 tablespoons yogurt","120 ml tomato sauce or tomato paste","2 tablespoons olive oil or canola oil","Preferred seasonings (suggested seasonings: turmeric, pepper, hot sauce, salt)"],"steps":["Cut tofu into 2.5 cm (1-inch) cubes.","Spread out the tofu on a cookie sheet and bake for 20–25 minutes at 170–190°C. This releases the extra water from the tofu and dries it out to be able to absorb the marinade.","Mix the spices, tomato sauce, yogurt, and oil in a bowl.","Let the tofu marinate well (about 8 hours) in this mixture, preferably in the refrigerator.","After marinating, thread the tofu onto skewers and grill it."]}]}
